Name: Tongsuo
URL: https://github.com/Tongsuo-Project/Tongsuo
Version: 8.5.0
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE.txt, NOTICE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: no

Description:
Pinned source reference and independent interoperability test implementation.
The browser uses its current BoringSSL baseline, including locally ported
national algorithms and protocols. No production GN target imports this
dependency. source.json preserves the exact reference archive and SHA-256;
LICENSE.txt and NOTICE preserve its attribution. Legacy build tools are
retained only to reproduce external test peers, not as browser prerequisites.

Local Modifications:
No reference-source modifications. Tongsuo headers and libraries must not enter
production BoringSSL consumers or browser packages.
